  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: rewrite rule bypass with encoded characters\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2025-31651.patch: encode literal '%', ';' and '?' in\n       the URL before the rewrite rules are evaluated and treat '%' as safe when\n       re-encoding afterwards in\n       java/org/apache/catalina/valves/rewrite/RewriteValve.java, stop truncating\n       the decoded URI at the first ';' when a rewritten request is re-dispatched\n       in java/org/apache/catalina/connector/CoyoteAdapter.java, add tests to\n       test/org/apache/catalina/valves/rewrite/TestRewriteValve.java\n     - CVE-2025-31651",
